senses.gloss:
यमन, अस्, ई, अम्, restraining, curbing, taming,
governing, managing; (अस्), m. the god Yama;
(अम्), n. the act of restraining or holding, curbing;
binding; the being restrained, stopping, ceasing,
term, cessation, rest.

यामल यामल, अम्, n. = यमल, a pair;
N. of a class of Tantra works, (often wrongly written
जामल.)

यामिक, अस्, आ, अम्, being on watch or guard;
(अस्), m. a night-watcher, watchman, one who an-
nounces the watches, one on guard or duty at night;
(इका), f. = यामिनी, night.
—यामिक-भट, अस्, m.
a night-watcher, watchman.

यमिन्, ई, इनी, इ, restraining, curbing, controlling;
(ई), m. one who restrains himself, a sage who has sub-
dued his senses; (इनी), f., Ved. bringing forth twins.
